        {
          "text": "Yi ca Gileadia, azini Kadesi angu ’ba Hitia ’diyini­ria; yi ca Dania, engazu Dania yi ogo yi mu kalaasi cazu Sidonia, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.24.6",
